===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌʌpˈɹaɪtnəs/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The state of being [[moral]], [[honest]] and [[honourable]].
#: {{ux|en|You are responsible only for your own '''uprightness'''. See to that and all else will take care of itself. - Miles Williams Mathis}}
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The state of being [[erect]], or [[vertical]].
# {{lb|en|countable}} The result or product of being [[upright]].

